{"t":"Cake Keep Isle","s":"cake-keep-isle-b6271","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Cake_Keep_Isle_812e82.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Warning Icon Red\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"42\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Warning_Icon_Red_1eeb32.png\" width=\"50\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">This article or section is about an event NPC, creature, item, object, outfit or location.</p><br/><p>The information about this NPC, <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">creature</a>, item, object, outfit or location is only relevant during a certain event or quest, e.g. only during Christmas.</p><p style=\"font-style:italic;font-size:x-small;\">Do not remove the information on this page because you can't find the NPC/creature/item/object/outfit/location.</p><p style=\"line-height:6pt;font-size:6pt;width:100%;text-align:right;\">discuss</p></div><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Cake Keep Isle</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"map\">\n<img alt=\"Cake Keep Isle\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"203\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cake_Keep_Isle_812e82.png\" width=\"270\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruled by</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Kullu</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"organization\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Organizations</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Magic Bakery Alliance</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Local</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Hunting Places</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Quests</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghostship\">Ghostship</a></li></ul></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/a-piece-of-cake\">A Piece of Cake</a></li></ul></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.70<br/>December 8, 2010<br/>Winter Update 2010</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Event</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Cake Keep Isle</b> is an <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33308,32083,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">island (33308, 32083, 7)</a> south of <a href=\"#/wiki/Cormaya\">Cormaya</a>.\n</p><p>It is only accessible a few days a year, during the <a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Quests\">World Quest</a> <a href=\"#/quest/a-piece-of-cake\">A Piece of Cake</a>. A large cake can be found on the island once the event starts, and players have to eat it in order to succeed.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Cake Keep Isle NPCs (1 NPC)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Brutus%20The%20Baker\">Brutus The Baker</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Brutus%20The%20Baker\"><img alt=\"Brutus The Baker\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Brutus_The_Baker_8c2856.gif\" width=\"113\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Member of the Magic Bakery Alliance</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Cake Keep Isle</strong></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Objects\">Objects</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th><small>Move</small>\n</th>\n<th><small>Walk</small>\n</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:left;\">Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Anniversary Cake\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Anniversary Cake\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Anniversary_Cake_c961bf.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">It was introduced to celebrate <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%27s%2015th%20Anniversary\">Tibia's 15th Anniversary</a>. Can be obtained by using a Surprise Bag (Red) or using <a href=\"#/wiki/Anniversary%20Remains\">Anniversary Remains</a> left by <a href=\"#/wiki/Chayenne%20%28Creature%29\">Chayenne</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Count%20Tofifti%20%28Creature%29\">Count Tofifti</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Birthday Cake\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Birthday Cake\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Birthday_Cake_ce6add.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">It was introduced to celebrate Tibia's 20th Anniversary. Rewarded from <a href=\"#/wiki/Vigintia\">Vigintia</a>'s can knockdown minigame, <i>silver</i> category.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Birthday Layer Cake\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Birthday Layer Cake\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Birthday_Layer_Cake_b1ed29.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blue Cake Carpet\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Blue Cake Carpet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blue_Cake_Carpet_07371b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">You can move it around after folding it.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20%28Decorated%29\">Cake (Decorated)</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20%28Decorated%29\"><img alt=\"Cake (Decorated)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cake_Decorated_70bd54.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Made with oven and <a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\">Lump of Cake Dough</a>. It can be decorated using any sort of fruit, and once placed a candlestick onto it, it becomes a Party Cake.\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table id=\"w-toc\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\">\n<p><b>How to make a Decorated Cake</b>\n</p><p>To make a <i>Decorated Cake</i>, you need...\n</p><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">Flour</a> (can be gotten by harvesting <a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat\">wheat</a> in a <a href=\"#/wiki/Millstone\">millstone</a>)<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">Milk</a><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Oven\">Oven</a><br/>\nA Fruit (check table of fruits you may use here)<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Kitchen%20Knife\">Kitchen Knife</a><br/>\n</p><p>1. Get the milk into a trough or <a href=\"#/wiki/Bucket\">bucket</a>.<br/>\n2. Use flour with milk. You will get <a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\">cake dough</a>.<br/>\n3. Use the cake dough with an oven. You will get a <a href=\"#/wiki/Cake\">cake</a>.<br/>\n4. Use the knife on a fruit (check table of fruits you may use here) while having the cake in your <a href=\"#/wiki/Backpack\">backpack</a>. If you've done this correctly, there will now be red decorations on your cake, forming your <i>Decorated Cake</i>.<br/><br/>\nNote: You can make it become a Party Cake by placing a Candlestick onto it.<br/>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><br/>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p>One of these is needed during the <a href=\"#/quest/krailos-quest\">Krailos Quest</a>.<br/>Create 20 of these to obtain the With a Cherry on Top achievement and half of the Piece of Cake achievement.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cake (Item)\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Cake (Item)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cake_Item_7caed0.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">These are believed to be Unobtainable Items. They are movable versions of the objects that form the cake tower of <a href=\"#/quest/a-piece-of-cake\">A Piece of Cake</a> event.<br/>\n<p><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Cake with a Cherry </i> </span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cake (Pillar)\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Cake (Pillar)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cake_Pillar_e36687.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Some of these appear once a year during the <a href=\"#/quest/a-piece-of-cake\">A Piece of Cake</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Quests\">World Quest</a>, but cannot be eaten (as opposed to Cake (Wall)). They only serve to hold up the higher layers of the cake.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cake (Tile)\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Cake (Tile)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cake_Tile_4ef16b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">This cake appears once a year during the <a href=\"#/quest/a-piece-of-cake\">A Piece of Cake</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Quests\">World Quest</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cake (Wall)\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Cake (Wall)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cake_Wall_7204d8.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Many of these appear once a year during the <a href=\"#/quest/a-piece-of-cake\">A Piece of Cake</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Quests\">World Quest</a> and can be eaten. They will slowly reduce in size and several \"bites\" are required for it to be completely item, which will make into a <a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Base\">Cake Base</a>. Some of the corners of the big cake cannot be eaten.\n<p>One piece of this cake will regenerate hp/mana for 240 seconds (4 minutes) and make you 20% full.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Backpack\">Cake Backpack</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Backpack\"><img alt=\"Cake Backpack\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cake_Backpack_1d8b4e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Obtainable as a reward from the <a href=\"#/quest/a-piece-of-cake\">A Piece of Cake</a> event (introduced in February, 2014).\n<p>See Backpacks for general information regarding backpacks.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Base\">Cake Base</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Base\"><img alt=\"Cake Base\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cake_Base_c62503.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">There used to be some edible cake here. Step on it to cover your feet in cake.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Cabinet%20Kit\">Cake Cabinet Kit</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Cabinet%20Kit\"><img alt=\"Furniture Kit\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Furniture_Kit_3eaef7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Use it while standing inside a house to unpack a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Cake Cabinet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cake_Cabinet_916b74.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></span> Cake Cabinet.\n<p>Received from <a href=\"#/wiki/Brutus%20The%20Baker\">Brutus The Baker</a> during the <a href=\"#/quest/a-piece-of-cake\">A Piece of Cake</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Quests\">world quest</a>.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cake Cabinet\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Cake Cabinet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cake_Cabinet_916b74.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Cabinet%20Kit\">Cake Cabinet Kit</a> while standing inside a house to construct it. You can't put it into your backpack once unpacked. When the cabinet was initially introduced, it could briefly be bought as a kit from the Furniture shop in <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a>.<br/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cake Golem Soul Core\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Cake Golem Soul Core\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cake_Golem_Soul_Core_bf8eb9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"question-tick\" title=\"Unknown\">?</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Tapestry\">Cake Tapestry</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Tapestry\"><img alt=\"Cake Tapestry\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cake_Tapestry_395547.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Reward from <a href=\"#/quest/a-piece-of-cake\">A Piece of Cake</a> event.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cake with a Cherry\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Cake with a Cherry\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cake_with_a_Cherry_46ab70.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">These are believed to be Unobtainable Items. They are movable versions of the objects that form the cake tower of <a href=\"#/quest/a-piece-of-cake\">A Piece of Cake</a> event.<br/>\n<p><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Cake (Item) </i> </span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake\">Cake</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake\"><img alt=\"Cake\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cake_643303.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Made with oven and <a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\">Lump of Cake Dough</a>. Can be decorated in order to become a <a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20%28Decorated%29\">Decorated Cake</a>, and once decorated, you can place a candlestick onto it to make Party Cake.<br/>\n<table id=\"w-toc\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\">\n<p><b>How to make a Cake</b>\n</p><p>To make a <i>Cake</i>, you need...\n</p><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">Flour</a> (can be gotten by harvesting <a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat\">wheat</a> in a <a href=\"#/wiki/Millstone\">millstone</a>)<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">Milk</a><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Oven\">Oven</a><br/>\n</p><p>1. Get the milk into a trough or <a href=\"#/wiki/Bucket\">bucket</a>.<br/>\n2. Use flour with milk. You will get <a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\">cake dough</a>.<br/>\n3. Use the cake dough with an oven. You will get your <i>Cake</i>.<br/><br/>\nNotes: You can make it become a <a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20%28Decorated%29\">Decorated Cake</a> by decorating it with fruits.<br/>\n</p>\nYou can make the <a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20%28Decorated%29\">Decorated Cake</a> become a Party Cake by placing a Candlestick onto it.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p>Bake 30 of these to obtain the The Cake's the Truth achievement.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Carrot%20Cake\">Carrot Cake</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Carrot%20Cake\"><img alt=\"Carrot Cake\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Carrot_Cake_fd0c0c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">It will boost your Distance Fighting skill by 10 for one hour. If a <a href=\"#/wiki/Bullseye%20Potion\">Bullseye Potion</a> is used after you eat the cake, the skills from the cake are lost and you will only have the +5 skills from the Bullseye Potion, or if you die during the hour that you have the +10, the boost gets lost.\n<p>When using a Carrot Cake, Green Sparkles Effect <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Green Sparkles Effect\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Green_Sparkles_Effect_f26b9f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> will appear on the user who will get the following message: \"<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">Your distance skill is improved for the next hour.</span>\"\n</p><p>To create this dish, you must speak with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Djinn\">Djinn</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Jean%20Pierre\">Jean Pierre</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>, near the Marid Fortress, during the Hot Cuisine event.\n</p><p><b>Necessary Ingredients:</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Carrot\">Carrots</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Carrot\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Carrot_2667e2.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Vial\">Vial</a> of <a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">Milk</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Milk\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Milk_105cbe.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Lemon\">Lemon</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Lemon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lemon_8f1a93.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li>\n<li>10 ounces of <a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">Flour</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Flour\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flour_e828c3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li>\n<li>2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Egg\">Eggs</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Egg\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Egg_e38eb8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li>\n<li>10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Cookie\">Cookies</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Cookie\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cookie_af4426.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li>\n<li>2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Peanut\">Peanuts</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Peanut\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Peanut_cbd03f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li></ul>\n<p>Only obtainable through the <a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Chocolate%20Cake\">Chocolate Cake</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Chocolate%20Cake\"><img alt=\"Chocolate Cake\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Chocolate_Cake_d9db14.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Since the Christmas Update 2008, it is valued because it is needed for a quest. You can't put a candle on it.<br/>\n<br/><table id=\"w-toc\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\">\n<p><b>How to make a Chocolate Cake</b>\n</p><p>To make a <i>Cake</i>, you need...\n</p><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">Flour</a> (can be gotten by harvesting <a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat\">wheat</a> in a <a href=\"#/wiki/Millstone\">millstone</a>)<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">Milk</a><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Chocolate\">Bar of Chocolate</a><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Oven\">Oven</a><br/>\n</p><p>1. Get the milk into a trough or <a href=\"#/wiki/Bucket\">bucket</a>.<br/>\n2. Use flour with milk. You will get <a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\">cake dough</a>.<br/>\n3. Use the <a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\">Lump of Cake Dough</a> on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Chocolate\">Bar of Chocolate</a>. You will get a <a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Chocolate%20Dough\">Lump of Chocolate Dough</a>. <b>NB: Be careful <u>NOT</u> to try to use the <a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Chocolate\">Bar of Chocolate</a> first, or you will eat it!</b><br/>\n</p>\n4. Use the chocolate dough with an oven. You will get your <i>Cake</i>. </td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\nOne is needed for <a href=\"#/quest/the-hidden-city-of-beregar-quest\">The Hidden City of Beregar Quest</a>.<br/>\nBaking 10 of these will reward you with the Sweet Tooth achievement and half of the Piece of Cake achievement.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Cream%20Cake\">Cream Cake</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cream%20Cake\"><img alt=\"Cream Cake\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cream_Cake_991ebb.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">It can also be gotten in a Surprise Bag. <br/>\n<p>One of these cakes is an item needed for the <a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Festival%20Cake\">Festival Cake</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Festival%20Cake\"><img alt=\"Festival Cake\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Festival_Cake_6729bd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Part of the <a href=\"#/quest/25-years-of-tibia-quest\">25 Years of Tibia Quest</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Folded Blue Cake Carpet\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Folded Blue Cake Carpet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Folded_Blue_Cake_Carpet_5e55dd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Folded Green Cake Carpet\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Folded Green Cake Carpet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Folded_Green_Cake_Carpet_fba472.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Folded Orange Cake Carpet\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Folded Orange Cake Carpet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Folded_Orange_Cake_Carpet_97c7d7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Folded Pink Cake Carpet\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Folded Pink Cake Carpet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Folded_Pink_Cake_Carpet_87edc3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Folded Purple Cake Carpet\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Folded Purple Cake Carpet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Folded_Purple_Cake_Carpet_f442db.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Folded Red Cake Carpet\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Folded Red Cake Carpet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Folded_Red_Cake_Carpet_5e3ebd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Folded Sky Cake Carpet\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Folded Sky Cake Carpet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Folded_Sky_Cake_Carpet_0701ef.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Folded Yellow Cake Carpet\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Folded Yellow Cake Carpet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Folded_Yellow_Cake_Carpet_b82b1a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Goggle Cake Soul Core\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Goggle Cake Soul Core\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Goggle_Cake_Soul_Core_25ded7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"question-tick\" title=\"Unknown\">?</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Green Cake Carpet\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Green Cake Carpet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Green_Cake_Carpet_74a25c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">You can move it around after folding it.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\">Lump of Cake Dough</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\"><img alt=\"Lump of Cake Dough\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lump_of_Cake_Dough_160cfd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">If you mix a <a href=\"#/wiki/Bucket\">bucket</a> or trough of <a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">milk</a> with <a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">flour</a> you will get a Lump of cake dough. If you use it on an oven you will receive <a href=\"#/wiki/Cake\">cake</a>. If you use it on any oven at the <a href=\"#/wiki/Christmas%20Bakery\">Christmas Bakery</a> (and if you know the <a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbread%20Recipe\">Gingerbread Recipe</a>) you can bake a <a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbreadman\">Gingerbreadman</a> instead. If you use it on a <a href=\"#/wiki/Baking%20Tray\">Baking Tray</a> you will get a Baking Tray (Cookie) use any oven to get 12 Cookies.<br/>\n<p>It looks the same as a Lump of Reed Flour Dough.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Meringue Cake\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Meringue Cake\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Meringue_Cake_545329.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Orange Cake Carpet\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Orange Cake Carpet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Orange_Cake_Carpet_772705.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">You can move it around after folding it.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Party Cake\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Party Cake\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Party_Cake_408c67.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Made with oven and <a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\">Lump of Cake Dough</a>. You can't eat it (you have to blow out the candle first).<br/>\n<p>It looks the same as an Odd Hat.\n<br/>\n</p>\n<table id=\"w-toc\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\">\n<p><b>How to make a Party Cake</b>\nTo make a <i>Party Cake</i>, you need...\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">Flour</a> (can be obtained by harvesting <a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat\">wheat</a> in a millstone)<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">Milk</a><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Oven\">Oven</a><br/>\nAny kind of Fruit<br/>\nKnife (utensil)<br/>\nCandlestick<br/>\n1. Get the milk into a trough or <a href=\"#/wiki/Bucket\">bucket</a>.<br/>\n2. Use flour with milk. You will get <a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\">cake dough</a>.<br/>\n3. Use the cake dough with an oven. You will get a <a href=\"#/wiki/Cake\">cake</a>.<br/>\n4. Use the knife on a fruit (check table of fruits you may use here) while having the cake in your <a href=\"#/wiki/Backpack\">backpack</a>. If you've done this correctly, there will now be red decorations on your cake, forming a <a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20%28Decorated%29\">decorated cake</a>.<br/>\n5. Put the cake on a surface and drop a Candlestick onto it.<br/>\n</p>\nVoila! A perfect <i>Party Cake</i>.</td></tr></tbody></table><br/>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p>Blow the candle out on 5 of these to obtain the Make a Wish achievement.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pink Cake Carpet\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Pink Cake Carpet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Pink_Cake_Carpet_3772eb.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">You can move it around after folding it.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Purple Cake Carpet\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Purple Cake Carpet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Purple_Cake_Carpet_407d9d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">You can move it around after folding it.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Red Cake Carpet\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Red Cake Carpet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Red_Cake_Carpet_8a8db1.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">You can move it around after folding it.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rose Milk Cake Recipe\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Rose Milk Cake Recipe\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rose_Milk_Cake_Recipe_65160f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"question-tick\" title=\"Unknown\">?</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">It can be found inside a chest in <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRGVzc2VydF9EdW5nZW9uP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Dessert Dungeon (page does not exist)\">Dessert Dungeon</span> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Candia\">Candia</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33454,32132,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33454, 32132, 9)</a>. It can only be picked up after finishing the <a href=\"#/quest/threatened-dreams-quest\">Threatened Dreams Quest - Sweet Dreams</a>.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Rose%20Milk%20Cake\">Rose Milk Cake</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Rose%20Milk%20Cake\"><img alt=\"Rose Milk Cake\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rose_Milk_Cake_187e7f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"question-tick\" title=\"Unknown\">?</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">You have a 100% chance to loot the <a href=\"#/wiki/Rose%20Milk%20Cake\">Rose Milk Cake</a> until you hand it into NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Sugar%20Plum%20Fairy\">Sugar Plum Fairy</a> during part of the <a href=\"#/quest/threatened-dreams-quest\">Threatened Dreams Quest - Sweet Dreams</a>. After handing them in, the chance of looting this item again becomes very low.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sky Cake Carpet\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Sky Cake Carpet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sky_Cake_Carpet_459318.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">You can move it around after folding it.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Throwing Cake\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Throwing Cake\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Throwing_Cake_1eb0df.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">Details can be confirmed on the market. Not known to exist on any game worlds right now.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Valentine's Cake\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Valentine's Cake\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Valentine_s_Cake_249cb4.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Yellow Cake Carpet\n</td>\n<td class=\"item-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Yellow Cake Carpet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Yellow_Cake_Carpet_32a5ab.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bool\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">You can move it around after folding it.\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>","quests":["a-piece-of-cake"]}